### Peticiones de prueba para payment-service (Sesión 4)
### IntelliJ IDEA (HTTP Client): los login guardan el token con client.global.set(...).
### VS Code (REST Client): copia el accessToken de cada login en la variable {{...Token}} correspondiente.
### Ejecuta primero los login. Cobrar requiere CUSTOMER; consultar pagos, ADMIN. La carpeta SIMULACIÓN es pública (herramienta del curso).

@host = http://localhost:8083/api/v1
@auth = http://localhost:8084/api/v1
# Cambia estos valores por los ids que devuelven las peticiones "Crear ..."
@paymentId = 1

### ---------- AUTENTICACIÓN (ejecutar primero) ----------

### Login CUSTOMER Ana (ana@mail.com) -> 200
POST {{auth}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@mail.com",
  "password": "Customer123!"
}

> {% client.global.set("anaToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Login ADMIN (admin@ticketing.pe) -> 200
POST {{auth}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@ticketing.pe",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### ---------- PAGOS ----------

### S4: Crear pago sin token -> 401
POST {{host}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": 100,
  "customerEmail": "ana@mail.com",
  "amount": 900.0
}

### Crear pago como CUSTOMER -> 201 APPROVED
POST {{host}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": 100,
  "customerEmail": "ana@mail.com",
  "amount": 900.0
}

### Crear pago que supera el límite (2000) -> 201 REJECTED
POST {{host}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": 101,
  "customerEmail": "ana@mail.com",
  "amount": 4500.0
}

### Crear pago inválido -> 400 con lista de errores
POST {{host}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": 0,
  "customerEmail": "x",
  "amount": -5
}

### S4: Listar pagos como CUSTOMER -> 403
GET {{host}}/payments?bookingId=100
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}

### Obtener pago por id (ADMIN) -> 200
GET {{host}}/payments/{{paymentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Pagos de una reserva (ADMIN) -> 200
GET {{host}}/payments?bookingId=100
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Pago inexistente -> 404
GET {{host}}/payments/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ---------- SIMULACIÓN ----------

### Ver la simulación actual -> 200
GET {{host}}/simulation

### Fallar siempre (failureRate 1.0) -> 200
PUT {{host}}/simulation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "failureRate": 1.0,
  "delay": "PT0S"
}

### Crear pago con la simulación activa -> 503
POST {{host}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": 102,
  "customerEmail": "ana@mail.com",
  "amount": 100.0
}

### Volver a la normalidad -> 200
PUT {{host}}/simulation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "failureRate": 0.0,
  "delay": "PT0S"
}
